                license and open a pull request on{' '}
                <a
                  href="https://github.com/a2ui-project/a2ui"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                >
                  a2ui-project/a2ui
                </a>{' '}
                with your repository, component catalog, and walkthrough media.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
